              "text" : "<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: block;\"><font face=\"Tahoma\">Strong middle schools focus on how students learn, not only what they learn. At Zeta, students engage in rigorous, discussion-based classes across subjects and build independence through daily practice, reading, and analysis. By eighth grade, students complete high school-level coursework, take the Algebra I and Biology Regents, and are prepared to thrive in a demanding high school environment.</font><br /></span>"
