                "fontWeight" : "{!$brand.fontWeight.normal}",
                "letterSpacing" : "normal",
                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "<font face=\"Tahoma\">Middle school is a time of identity formation. At Zeta, students choose creative and movement electives each semester and deepen those interests through clubs and teams. Alongside shared traditions and experiences, this builds a strong sense of belonging and lasting friendships.</font><br /><br />"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
