              "text" : "<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: block;\"></span><font face=\"Tahoma\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: block;\">Zeta students participate in eight experiential field trips over the course of middle school. These include a trip to Philadelphia and our signature eighth-grade Leadership Summit in Washington, D.C.  The trips are designed to build independence, teamwork, cultural awareness, and foster friendships for life. <br /><br />As you consider your next step, the most important thing is to experience a school in person and see how it feels for your family.<br /><br /><a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">We invite you to join us at an upcoming event.</a> <br /><br />Visiting  a school is an important part of this decision. We would love to welcome you, show you around, and help you picture your child at Zeta.<br /><br /></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: block;\">Warmly,<br /><strong></strong><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br /><em><br />Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta, our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way. <br />✉️<a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</u></a><br />&#x1f4de;<a href=\"tel:16464801654\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener norefer